OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 24 DEC
OL,4,G0630FAled Jones
OL,5,     GJoin Aled for an uplifting start
OL,6,     Gto the day with the very best
OL,7,     Gclassical music and Christmas
OL,8,     Gcarols, along with the latest
OL,9,     Gnews and travel updates.
OL,10,G1000FJohn Brunning
OL,11,     GJoin John Brunning as he keeps
OL,12,     Gyou company through the morning
OL,13,     Gwith the greatest classical music
OL,14,     Gand Christmas carols.
OL,15,G1300FClassic FM Requests
OL,16,     GYou're in control of the music
OL,17,     Gthis Christmas Eve. Let Anne-
OL,18,     GMarie know what you'd like to
OL,19,     Ghear, as she plays requested
OL,20,     Gcarols and festive music.
